      "writtenOn": "2017-07-04T22:10:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is how I would assume the procedure works:\n\n- download_image: download image into standby partition of the device\n- activate_image_update: change standby partition to active partition. \n- reboot_device: make image on active partition running on device. The reboot_device api should query the image info when it reestablishes connection to the device.",
